{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220710","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220710","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322071001:1":{"text":"데이먼, 널 위해 친구를 만들었단다. 어서 나와서 놀아보렴.","source_cn":"戴蒙，我们给你找了几个玩伴，快出来玩吧，好不好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2517B1F26CA23B57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322071002:1":{"text":"이 눈사람들은 아주 귀여운 데다, 밖은 아주 떠들썩하단다... 눈사람들의 웃음소리가 들리지?","source_cn":"这些小雪人很可爱，外面很热闹……你听到它们的笑声了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12891CF1116F1442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322071003:1":{"text":"데이먼... 아직도 화난 거니?","source_cn":"戴蒙……还在生气吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94E90121EAADF503","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322071004:1":{"text":"세미라와 니루가 무슨 말을 해도, 데이먼은 밖으로 나오긴커녕, 아무 말도 하지 않았다.","source_cn":"无论雪米拉和尼汝说什么，戴蒙都不肯出来，也不愿说一句话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF1BB213199E3342","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322071005:1":{"text":"데이먼... 휴... 이제 화 좀 풀으렴. 응?","source_cn":"戴蒙……唉……别生爸爸妈妈的气了，好不好？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x993B797034ED1F07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322071006:1":{"text":"그래, 데이먼. 어서 나와서 치피와 함께 눈싸움하자!","source_cn":"对呀，戴蒙，你快出来吧？满满陪你打雪仗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BCC0F22AEF405B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322071007:0":{"text":"내가 불꽃 마법을 보여줄게!","source_cn":"我可以给你看烟花魔法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66B064DF7E430ED4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1322071008:0":{"text":"우리가 무슨 말을 해도, 데이먼은 여전히 아무런 대답이 없었다","source_cn":"不管大家说了什么，戴蒙依旧一声不吭","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74681BC4252B200D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1322071009:0":{"text":"평소에 이렇게 조용한 아이가 아닌데...","source_cn":"他平时没这么安静……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E2C4B630DCAF133","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322071010:0":{"text":"...계속 아무 말이 없는걸 보니, 어딘가 아픈 게 아닐까요...?","source_cn":"……戴蒙他一直不说话，会不会是生病了不舒服……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBC2D2B9109A9B88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1322071011:0":{"text":"안 되겠어요. 가봐야 할 것 같아요..."